{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5852f9aa9dc5a833d3bc2","chatId":"66a97d5cab5b44098627e5acda9157d6","sessionId":null,"userId":93237,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1053,"promptTokens":2241,"completionTokens":89,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:21:51"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009706395864343478,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5852f9aa9dc5a833d3bc1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475311880,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:21:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5852f9aa9dc5a833d3bc1","chatId":"66a97d5cab5b44098627e5acda9157d6","sessionId":null,"userId":93237,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n张华是一位受人尊敬的医生，他在菜园里种了许多昂贵和珍稀的药草。隔壁村的李青因为母亲病重，急需一味非常稀有的药草，当他路过菜园时发现居然找到了他一直都找不到的药草，心里非常激动，以为这是一片地是没主的，便把药草摘下了。王晓是张华的学徒，他看到了李青的行为，但由于他听街坊邻居说过李青母亲的情况，决定不告诉张华。当张华发现药草不见时，便开始询问周围的人。最后，李青才知道那片菜园归张华所属，便上门承认了他的行为。\n\n[问题]\n王晓在看到李青摘走药草却没有告诉张华时，他会感到什么样的情绪？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 王晓可能会感到矛盾和担忧，因为他在尊重师傅的财产和同情李青的困境之间感到纠结。\nB. 王晓可能感到困惑，因为他不知道是否应该介入李青的行为。\nC. 王晓可能感到无动于衷，因为他认为这不是他的责任。\nD. 王晓可能感到满意，因为他帮助了李青解决了迫切的问题。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009706395864343478,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5852f9aa9dc5a833d3bc2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475311878,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:21:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"0570f7a41af0410bb575f460ab82983a"}